[{"client_msg_id":"05808c69-1e26-4f4c-94d4-72f2de6fb81a","type":"message","user":"U023TTSQ87P","text":"ここにはgoに詳しい人が多いと思うのでお伺いしたいのですが、このUDPのサーバーに dig version 9.16.21 から any でリクエストすると connection refuse が発生してしまうのですが、原因ってなんでしょうか？\n今の所anyのみ発生します。\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/bootjp/9fb04ce339e94f05bc4dba483806aa57\u003e","ts":"1634385040.425200","thread_ts":"1634385040.425200","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iXvI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f6ff512-7140-469a-805c-ce945095f2ef","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁ、固定配列定義すればなんとかなるか。","ts":"1634384792.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fFAq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b45da83-7399-457b-8681-72d20081fc5c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これ壊れると結構色んな物が動かなくなる。stackoverflow のプロダクトとか tailscale とか。","ts":"1634384103.423500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/JWA6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a427c1a8-220b-47ca-8c98-e7cd9d9a5fc6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"メンバの順が定義順なのでうまく行ってるプロダクトを作っている人です。(go-ole)","ts":"1634384046.422200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a88ab9d-eb7a-472d-8c3e-3df50efebc99","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Makefile 時代","ts":"1634364928.420700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4kj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e16d51d8-2411-4322-9f30-7f02aed3e7f1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/commit/0ddfe70c27304f280779ba6cead1d1c41f506a0a\u003e 履歴さかのぼったら、存在した時点からすでにその問題を抱えていた","ts":"1634364907.420500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6nH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6f6f76a-e8f7-4235-a994-2ff43f171466","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"メンバ順序しんどい状況なんですよねぇ","ts":"1634362071.420100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/yN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9103b03e-d691-42e0-9e58-8a93f4ee039d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"つらみ、その意味だと自由も明確に規定しないとだめなんだなあ...","ts":"1634361497.419400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yYT1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb51093-6bac-4f51-9e12-0d962267a432","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"struct のメンバ順序はコンパイラが都合よく変えられる…はずだったのだが、 encoding/xml とかのせいで変えるに変えられなくなっているという認識","ts":"1634361302.418600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXBj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c071ec1-7808-4660-a2d9-8db660c0268c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mdempsky/maligned|https://github.com/mdempsky/maligned\u003e","ts":"1634357428.417800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"mdempsky/maligned","id":1,"title":"mdempsky/maligned","text":"Tool to detect Go structs that would take less memory if their fields were sorted.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"440","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a546965f-b033-4e71-8d15-92d1ba1d9a02","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ知らなかった","ts":"1634349628.417500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ib8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba2ed257-142b-4b8d-ad87-87591dd36674","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://christina04.hatenablog.com/entry/how-memory-allocate-when-struct\u003e","ts":"1634349625.417300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Carpe Diem: structのメモリ割り当て - Carpe Diem","id":1,"title":"structのメモリ割り当て - Carpe Diem","title_link":"https://christina04.hatenablog.com/entry/how-memory-allocate-when-struct","text":"概要 Goにおけるstructのメモリ構造を知ることでフィールド順序に対する意識が変わったり、なぜunsafe.Sizeof(string)が16bytesでunsafe.Sizeof(slice)が24bytesになるかが理解できます。 環境 Go 1.15.6 darwin 20.1.0 x86_64 各型のメモリ割り当て unsafe.Sizeof()を使うとその変数がどれくらいメモリを割り振るかが分かります。 ※変数の分確保するメモリであり、参照先のメモリは含みません 型 unsafe.Sizeof() bool 1 int32 4 int 8 float64 8 string 16 …","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/q/quoll00/20201205/20201205173457.png","blocks":null,"ts":1607167721,"service_name":"Carpe Diem","service_icon":"https://christina04.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://christina04.hatenablog.com/entry/how-memory-allocate-when-struct","original_url":"https://christina04.hatenablog.com/entry/how-memory-allocate-when-struct"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lmg5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21a9882b-f2d6-402b-adfa-b5025ecf04ff","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ですね","ts":"1634310637.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6SO5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d95417b4-96ec-4879-9279-69f28295302c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、CommandLineToArgvW だ。GetCommandLineArgs は .NET だ。","ts":"1634310280.416700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGHCXN79P"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ow2Hb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6d63583-0104-4450-928b-a1366fdd5fd9","type":"message","user":"U023TTSQ87P","text":"digがTCPにフォールバックしているのが原因かも","ts":"1634389683.425400","thread_ts":"1634385040.425200","edited":{"user":"U023TTSQ87P","ts":"1634391372.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U023TTSQ87P","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"el8g0"}]},{"